  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "وَ رُوِيَ: \"أَنَّ رَجُلًا جَاءَ بِرَجُلٍ إِلَى أَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ فَقَالَ يَا أَمِيرَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ إِنَّ هَذَا زَعَمَ أَنَّهُ احْتَلَمَ بِأُمِّي",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And it has been narrated: “A man brought another man to Amīr al-Muʾminīn عليه السلام and said: ‘O Amīr al-Muʾminīn, this man has claimed that he had a wet dream involving my mother.’”
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ \"إِنَّ الْحُلُمَ بِمَنْزِلَةِ الظِّلِّ فَإِنْ شِئْتَ جَلَدْتُ لَكَ ظِلَّهُ\"",
      "translations": {
        "en": "So he said: “Indeed, the dream is like a shadow; if you wish, I will flog his shadow for you.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "closing",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ \"لَكِنِّي أُوجِعُهُ لِئَلَّا يَعُودَ يُؤْذِي الْمُسْلِمِينَ\" \".",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then he عليه السلام said: “But I will punish him so that he does not return to harming the Muslims.”"
      }
    }
  ],
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "This report recounts a case brought before Amīr al-Muʾminīn عليه السلام concerning an offensive claim about a dream. He responds by distinguishing dreams from actionable realities, while still ordering disciplinary punishment to prevent harm and offense toward Muslims. The narration highlights judicial wisdom in balancing legal principle with public protection and deterrence.",
      "seo_question": "How did Amīr al-Muʾminīn عليه السلام judge a case involving an offensive claim about a dream?",
      "key_terms": {
        "الْحُلُمَ": "a dream, specifically the claimed dream at issue in the case",
        "بِمَنْزِلَةِ الظِّلِّ": "like a shadow; something without tangible legal substance in itself",
        "جَلَدْتُ": "I would flog; a reference to corporal punishment",
        "أُوجِعُهُ": "I will inflict pain on him; meaning to discipline or punish him",
        "يُؤْذِي الْمُسْلِمِينَ": "he harms the Muslims; causing offense or injury to others"
      }
    }
  },
